        <body>
            <div xml:id="d398">

                <pb facs="0566" n="460" sameAs="frus:frus1906p1/pg460"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Chargé Sleeper to the Secretary of State.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1906-08-29"><hi rendition="#small-caps">August</hi> 29,
                            1906</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. Sleeper reports that Asbert, the rebel leader, Habana Province, is quoted in
                    La Discussion as threatening to burn foreign properties after 15th proximo,
                    unless Government grants demands of revolutionists.)</p>
            </div>
        </body>
